@api = http://127.0.0.1:3333

### Health check
GET {{api}}/

### Item pelo QR code
GET {{api}}/qr-info/QR001

### Cadastro
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Maria", "email": "maria@exemplo.com", "senha": "123456", "telefone": "19999990000" }

### Login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "maria@exemplo.com", "senha": "123456" }

### Dados do usuário
GET {{api}}/auth/user/1

### Criar reserva
POST {{api}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario_id": 1,
  "nome_cliente": "Maria",
  "email_cliente": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "telefone_cliente": "19999990000",
  "data_visita": "2030-01-15",
  "horario_visita": "10:00",
  "numero_visitantes": 2,
  "tipo_tour": "premium"
}

### Vagas em um horário
GET {{api}}/reservations/check-availability/2030-01-15/10:00

### Reservas do usuário
GET {{api}}/reservations/user/1

### Confirmar reserva
PATCH {{api}}/reservations/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "confirmada" }
